  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the influx of people, and not everyone being involved with the discord, twitter, or any other social media platform - a global notifications system might help.  \n\n\"What is a Global Notification System?\" \nSimple, a tool devs can utilize to communicate to everyone across every world to every instance to notify them of important matters like known issues they are aware of, incoming patches, and so forth.\nAn example of a system like this being utilized would be WoW, though not as fancy, it would warn people in servers when a mandatory restart would be happening (which are typically planned but is in place to give people the heads up, or you could look at Ark for example, which, also wouldn't be as fancy).\n\nThe system would help clear up any unnecessary confusion and help those understand that a game with an unprecedented amount of new players - can only do so much.",
